{"title": "Hexed Weapon (Condition)", "pageid": 49004, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact Weapon Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Hexed Weapon</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The warlock bound to this weapon is always <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with it.</li>\n<li>The weapon's damage is magical and uses the warlock's <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier.</li>\n<li>When the warlock attacks with this weapon, there is a chance that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\">Hexblade's Curse</a> will be applied to the target. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HEXBLADE_BIND</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HEXBLADE_BIND+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HEXBLADE_BIND+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">PACT_BLADE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPACT_BLADE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPACT_BLADE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Hexblade.27s_Curse\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Hexblade's_Curse\">Condition: Hexblade's Curse</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\">Hexblade's Curse</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Cursed by a Hexblade warlock. The warlock who cursed this entity adds their <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a> to damage rolls against them. The number they need to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">roll</a> a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking this entity is also reduced by 1.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The roll to apply Hexblade's Curse is a d20 with no modifiers which must roll at least 17. This means it has a fixed 20% chance to apply and is unaffected by anything that adjusts dice rolls such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li>\n<li>The duration for Hexblade's Curse cannot be refreshed by attacking with a Hexed Weapon. It can only be applied to targets that are not currently cursed.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Hexed_Weapon\">Sources of Hexed Weapon</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Flail\" title=\"Pactbound Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Pactbound_Flail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Flail\" title=\"Pactbound Flail\">Pactbound Flail</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Maul\" title=\"Pactbound Maul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Pactbound_Maul_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Maul\" title=\"Pactbound Maul\">Pactbound Maul</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Sickle\" title=\"Pactbound Sickle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Pactbound_Sickle_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pactbound_Sickle\" title=\"Pactbound Sickle\">Pactbound Sickle</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/45px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/60px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/30px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\">Bind Hexed Weapon</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Flail\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Pact_of_the_Blade_Flail_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Flail\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Flail\">Pact of the Blade: Flail</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Pact_of_the_Blade_Maul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Maul\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Maul\">Pact of the Blade: Maul</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Sickle\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Pact_of_the_Blade_Sickle_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade:_Sickle\" title=\"Pact of the Blade: Sickle\">Pact of the Blade: Sickle</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>PACT_BLADE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hexed_Weapon\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexed_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexed Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Hexed Weapon</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The warlock bound to this weapon is always <a href=\"/wiki/Proficient\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficient\">Proficient</a> with it.</li>\n<li>The weapon's damage is magical and uses the warlock's <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifier.</li>\n<li>When the warlock attacks with this weapon, there is a chance that <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hexblade's Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade%27s_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Hexblade's Curse (Condition)\">Hexblade's Curse</a> will be applied to the target.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Pact_Weapon\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Pact Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Pact_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Pact Weapon (Condition)\">Pact Weapon</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The warlock bound to this weapon is always <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficient</a> with it. The weapon's damage is magical.</li>\n<li>The weapon uses the caster's <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Ability_score_modifiers\" title=\"Abilities\">Charisma modifier</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and damage rolls.</li>\n<li>Prevents the weapon from being dropped or otherwise disarmed.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201222\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.117 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.127 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4863/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 83331/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 23683/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.061/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1494633/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  105.033      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%  105.033      1 -total\n 55.95%   58.768      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 38.27%   40.198      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 29.45%   30.935      7 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 20.48%   21.507     12 Template:Icon_link\n 19.35%   20.322     12 Template:Icon_text\n 19.09%   20.046     54 Template:Trim\n 18.87%   19.815      3 Template:MdRarityItem\n 15.95%   16.753      3 Template:Item_icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:49004-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201222 and revision id 395182. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}